  "2026-08-08T16:46:57.644Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence (2026-08-08): full release pipeline reached the pre-commit hosted-review boundary after all local gates passed. Exact coverage: 460 files, 7072 tests, statements 50283/50283, branches 36738/36738, functions 10330/10330, lines 48684/48684. Static quality/docstrings, docs/skills, SDK surface, package boundary/parity, token/context/retrieval/tracker/security/version, packed npx (13 packages), and 88-command temporary package-first dogfood all passed. Manual packed external acceptance also passed all-status duplicates, 13 unique package rows with aliases, SDK direction-independent merge, package-manage output resolution, merge install, and health classification. The remaining greptile gate refusal is expected before a reviewable commit: no committed code changes to review against main."
